.SS "map generate"
Generate a map at one exact seed
.PP
Usage: glob2 map generate GENERATOR [OPTIONS]
.TP
.B \-\-seed
Map seed (unsigned 32\-bit) Default: 1. Type: integer. Range: 0..4294967295.
.TP
.B \-\-set
Generator control KEY=VALUE; CLI overrides config Type: assignment. Repeatable.
.TP
.B \-\-width
Map width in tiles; registered values only Type: integer. Range: 1..512.
.TP
.B \-\-height
Map height in tiles; registered values only Type: integer. Range: 1..512.
.TP
.B \-\-teams
Number of colonies; registered values only Type: integer. Range: 1..32.
.TP
.B \-\-workers
Initial workers per colony; registered values only Type: integer. Range: 0..2147483647.
.TP
.B \-\-preview
Overview PNG output Type: file.
.TP
.B \-\-preview\-size
Longest preview side in pixels Type: integer. Units: pixels. Range: 128..4096.
.TP
.B \-\-preview\-scale
Scale retained thumbnail pixels Default: 2. Allowed: 2, 4, 8. Type: enum.
.TP
.B \-\-data\-dir
Add an asset search directory (in order) Type: directory. Repeatable.
.TP
.B \-\-generator\-package
Load a custom generator package or directory Type: file. Repeatable.
.TP
.B \-\-output
Playable gzip map output; .gz is appended Type: file.
.TP
.B \-\-report\-file
Detailed map JSON report Type: file.
.TP
.B \-\-config
KEY=VALUE configuration; CLI settings override it Type: file.
.TP
.B \-\-map\-image
Export categorical terrain PNG Type: file.
.TP
.B \-\-export\-generator\-package
Export selected custom generator package Type: file.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show this command's help (also \-h) Default: false.
.PP
At least one output is required
.PP
Registered generator controls constrain tile sizes and values
.PP
A failed layout never silently retries with another seed
.PP
Choose at most one: \-\-preview\-scale, \-\-preview\-size
.PP
.nf
glob2 map generate river \-\-seed 713 \-\-width 128 \-\-height 128 \-\-teams 2 \-\-output artifacts/river.map \-\-preview artifacts/river.png
.fi
.PP
Outputs: Requested .map.gz, overview PNG, categorical PNG and JSON report
.PP
Platform: all
